  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "CB1652CD6932588B",
      "text": "♪Rotom, tom...\\nRotom, tom...♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "86C1998FCFED7A81",
      "text": "¿Te has deshecho del Recluta de la entrada?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "86C1968FCFED7568",
      "text": "Esta base es el punto de reunión del Escuadrón\\nSchedar, el grupo Fuego del Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "86C1978FCFED771B",
      "text": "Su jefa, Melo, es la integrante más polivalente\\nde toda la pandilla.\\c\\nNo hay problema que se le resista, aunque suele\\nrecurrir a métodos un tanto coercitivos.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 160,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "86C19C8FCFED7F9A",
      "text": "Conociéndola, estará subiéndose por las paredes\\ndesde que recibió nuestra declaración de guerra.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "86C19D8FCFED814D",
      "text": "Y los Reclutas de la base estarán intentando\\nmantener su furia bajo control y que no estalle.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "86C19A8FCFED7C34",
      "text": "Nuestra mejor opción ahora mismo es derrotar a\\ntodos, uno tras otro, e irlos despachando.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "86C19B8FCFED7DE7",
      "text": "Cuando ya no quede nadie intentando calmarla,\\nserá cuestión de tiempo que Melo dé la cara.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_020_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "86C1908FCFED6B36",
      "text": "[EMPTY 15]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
